{#
  CONSENT BANNER — "A, the window card". Bottom-left, on every V4 page, until
  the visitor answers; "Cookie settings" in the footer brings it back.

  The little window is the hero's own (Assets/v4/consent/window.svg, the
  closed drawing with its panes see-through), built as the hero's is (v4/sky-window.njk):
  two wings over a bit of sky, each with the open sash drawn on its back, and
  the open frame coming in behind. "Sure, peek away" swings them open; "Keep
  the curtains closed" draws two curtains across. Then the card goes. scripts/v4-consent.js holds
  the logic; partials/head-analytics.njk what each answer turns on.
#}
<aside class="v4-consent" data-consent role="dialog" aria-labelledby="v4-consent-title" aria-describedby="v4-consent-body" hidden>
  <div class="v4-consent__window" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="v4-consent__sky">
      <i class="v4-consent__sun"></i>
      <i class="v4-consent__curtain v4-consent__curtain--left"></i>
      <i class="v4-consent__curtain v4-consent__curtain--right"></i>
    </span>
    <img class="v4-consent__frame" src="/Assets/v4/consent/window-open-frame.svg" alt="" width="818" height="325" />
    <span class="v4-consent__wing v4-consent__wing--left">
      <img class="v4-consent__leaf v4-consent__leaf--left" src="/Assets/v4/consent/window.svg" alt="" width="595" height="242" />
      <img class="v4-consent__back v4-consent__back--left" src="/Assets/v4/sky/sash-back-l.png" alt="" width="312" height="242" />
    </span>
    <span class="v4-consent__wing v4-consent__wing--right">
      <img class="v4-consent__leaf v4-consent__leaf--right" src="/Assets/v4/consent/window.svg" alt="" width="595" height="242" />
      <img class="v4-consent__back v4-consent__back--right" src="/Assets/v4/sky/sash-back-r.png" alt="" width="343" height="242" />
    </span>
  </div>
  <p class="v4-consent__title" id="v4-consent-title">{{ home.consent.title }}</p>
  <p class="v4-consent__body" id="v4-consent-body">{{ home.consent.body }}</p>
  <div class="v4-consent__actions">
    <button class="v4-consent__button v4-consent__button--yes" type="button" data-consent-answer="granted">{{ home.consent.yes }}</button>
    <button class="v4-consent__button v4-consent__button--no" type="button" data-consent-answer="denied">{{ home.consent.no }}</button>
  </div>
</aside>
